    "notes": [
      "si builds the source list from the current working-tree data and every completed turn, then renders the frame with the tab strip, the file list and the detail view.",
      "List mode shows the file rows with a fixed window of seven; detail mode shows pBe and routes eight scroll actions through Ffe's scroll handle.",
      "The title is the current diff or the selected turn; the subtitle carries the turn prompt, the branch comparison or the working-tree base; the empty message distinguishes turn, notice, too-many-files and no-changes.",
      "Cancel returns to the list from detail and otherwise dismisses with the source text and system display.",
      "Tab pages are hidden when there is one source; per-tab content keeps the list/detail view."
    ]
